"# Rendered by hermetic for agent atlas. Final file, no templating.
#
# Seeded into /data/hermes/.hermes/config.yaml on first boot, and only then.
# Everything here is yours to change — from this agent's dashboard, or with
# \`hermes config set\`. hermetic will not write it again.
#
